      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Your dracoleum gland becomes empowered, inflicting debilitating conditions when you use your Draichsar Breath. Creatures who fail their saves gain one of the following conditions for 1 round, or 2 rounds on a critical failure, based on the damage type of your breath: clumsy 1 (electricity, fire, cold, or sonic damage), enfeebled 1 (acid, piercing, slashing, or bludgeoning damage), or stupefied 1 (force, mental, vitality, or void damage).</span></p>"
